  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 1bcc0126920679944ae94db38b117f0b, type: 3}
  m_Name: Dock
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::LocationDefinition
  locationId: Docks
  displayName: Docks
  description: 'The docks stretch along the edge of the district, a maze of rusted
    walkways, loading cranes, warehouses, and old cargo containers stacked three
    or four high. The smell of salt hangs in the air, mixed with fuel, rotting fish,
    and the metallic stink of machinery that should probably have been replaced decades
    ago.

    Workers move between the warehouses in small groups. Most of them keep
    their heads down. A cargo hauler crawls past you, its engine coughing black smoke
    as it disappears behind Warehouse Nine.

    Further along the waterfront, a
    collection of fishing vessels are tied against the old concrete piers. Some look
    operational. Others seem to have become permanent homes for whoever couldn''t
    afford somewhere better.

    Across the water you can just make out the lights
    of the industrial platforms. At this distance they almost look peaceful.

    Almost.

    Somewhere
    inside the warehouse district, something heavy crashes to the ground. Nobody
    nearby reacts.

    There are several places worth investigating.'
  settings: 3
  actions:
  - {fileID: 11400000, guid: c26a4555ca7ba264e86c27be23c6c8d4, type: 2}
